  "bodyHash": "0d17dae6ad33b12d",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/bundle.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 捆绑包。用心制作。将 Serilum 的模组整合在一起，方便下载！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-bundle.svg\" alt=\"关于此捆绑包\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>RPG 捆绑包</strong>是一种特殊的模组类型，它将 Serilum 的多个<strong>rpg 类型</strong>模组整合到一个文件中。虽然我将这些模组归类在一起非常困难，但我尝试这样做是为了让安装变得更加容易。它使用了一种名为 JiJ（Jar in Jar，即 Jar 内嵌 Jar）的系统。这意味着所包含的模组保持完全独立，但允许像整合包一样进行捆绑安装。所有模组仍然拥有各自的配置文件，并且你会在游戏内的模组列表中看到它们全部列出。<br><br>该捆绑包是整合包开发的额外辅助工具，但它并不替代我个人偏好的模块化模组系统。不过，可以通过捆绑包的配置文件禁用其中包含的模组。<strong>更改配置后需要重启游戏才能生效。</strong><br><br>由于 JiJ 系统的工作方式，它既兼容单独正常安装该模组，也兼容与捆绑包中包含的模组同时安装。这主要用于强制使用特定版本，但如果不小心以这种方式重复安装了模组也不会造成问题。虽然这可能不是大问题，但最好还是只安装一次。因此，如果您决定安装此捆绑包，可以移除任何已安装的属于此捆绑包的其他模组。<br><br>我希望这个捆绑包对喜欢大型内容模组的你们有用。非常感谢多年来大家的支持！<br><br></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg\" alt=\"环境：客户端 &amp; 服务端\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableAnvilRestoration</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableAreas</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableBarebackHorseRiding</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableBottleYourXp</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableCampfireSpawnandTweaks</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableDespawningEggsHatch</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableDoubleDoors</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableDragonDropsElytra</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableEndPortalRecipe</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableErodingStoneEntities</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableFishOnTheLine</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableFlowerMimics</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableGrabbyMobs</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableGrindstoneSharperTools</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableHealingCampfire</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableIcePreventsCropGrowth</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableJustMobHeads</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableJustPlayerHeads</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableMineralChance</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableNaturallyChargedCreepers</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableNetherPortalSpread</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableNoHostilesAroundCampfire</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableOverworldPiglins</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enablePetNames</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enablePiglinNames</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enablePumpkillagersQuest</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableRainBeGoneRitual</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableRandomVillageNames</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableRealisticBees</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableSmallerNetherPortals</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableSnowballsFreezeMobs</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableSpidersProduceWebs</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableVillageSpawnPoint</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableVillagerNames</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>enableWeakerSpiderwebs</strong>&nbsp;(默认 = true)</span></div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/available-bundles.svg\" alt=\"可用捆绑包\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">以下 Serilum 模组捆绑包可供使用：</span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-client-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#006994\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-client-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 客户端捆绑包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-customization-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#999\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-customization-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 自定义捆绑包</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-extra-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#804d4f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 额外功能捆绑包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-qol-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#bf8f6f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 生活质量 (QoL) 捆绑包</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-rpg-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#006b3f\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum RPG 捆绑包</a></td>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/serilums-spawn-bundle.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#805a46\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-spawn-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum 生成控制捆绑包</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/mods-included.svg\" alt=\"包含的模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/anvil-restoration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/anvil-restoration.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/anvil-restoration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">鐵砧修復</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">使用鐵錠修復已放置的鐵砧，並用黑曜石損壞它們。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/areas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/areas.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/areas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">區域</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">使用告示牌創建具有半徑的自定義命名區域/城鎮/區域，並通過 GUI 提供加入/離開消息。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bareback-horse-riding\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/bareback-horse-riding.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bareback-horse-riding\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">無鞍騎馬</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允許在調整遊戲機制的情況下騎乘沒有馬鞍的馬。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bottle-your-xp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/bottle-your-xp.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bottle-your-xp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">經驗瓶</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允許使用你收集的經驗值製作經驗瓶（附魔之瓶）。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/campfire-spawn-and-tweaks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">營火重生與調整</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">在首選營火內以短時間火焰抗性跨維度重生，並改變方塊機制。放置未點燃的營火，點燃它將創設一個家園重生點。移除水浸特性。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/despawning-eggs-hatch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/despawning-eggs-hatch.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/despawning-eggs-hatch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">消失中的雞蛋孵化</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">草垛上的雞蛋在即將消失前會安全孵化成小雞。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/double-doors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/double-doors.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/double-doors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">雙扇門</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">多個相同的雙扇門、陷阱門和柵欄門可以同時打開。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragon-drops-elytra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/dragon-drops-elytra.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dragon-drops-elytra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">龍掉落鞘翅</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">一個極簡模塊，使終界龍死亡時掉落鞘翅。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/end-portal-recipe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/end-portal-recipe.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/end-portal-recipe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">終界門配方</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">使終界門可合成、可移動，並在生存模式中可用，以及其他調整。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eroding-stone-entities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/eroding-stone-entities.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eroding-stone-entities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">風化石質實體</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">留在流動水中的石質方塊實體會變成黏土和沙子。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fish-on-the-line\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/fish-on-the-line.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fish-on-the-line\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">魚上鉤鈴聲</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">釣魚時，當有魚上鉤時，手持副手物品中的鈴鐺會響起。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/flower-mimics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/flower-mimics.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/flower-mimics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">花朵模仿者</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">驚悚節 2023：晚上要小心花朵……它們可能會變成怪物！</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/grabby-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/grabby-mobs.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/grabby-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">抓取生物</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允許所有能夠攜帶裝備的生物撿起地上的物品。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/grindstone-sharper-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/grindstone-sharper-tools.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/grindstone-sharper-tools\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">研磨機銳化工具</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">研磨機（濕石）可以暫時增加在其上使用工具的傷害。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/healing-campfire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/healing-campfire.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/healing-campfire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">治療營火</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">在（靈魂）營火周圍創建一個區域，玩家和被动生物在該區域內獲得再生效果。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-prevents-crop-growth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/ice-prevents-crop-growth.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-prevents-crop-growth\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰阻止作物生長</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">為了設計目的，底部有冰的生長作物將保持在同一階段。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-mob-heads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/just-mob-heads.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-mob-heads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">僅生物頭顱</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">僅使用原版資源，為生物掉落其頭顱設置可配置的概率。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-player-heads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/just-player-heads.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-player-heads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">僅玩家頭顱</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允許通過命令或死亡事件收集玩家頭顱。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mineral-chance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/mineral-chance.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mineral-chance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">礦物機率</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">玩家在主世界和下界挖掘時，可以在石質方塊中找到礦物。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/naturally-charged-creepers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/naturally-charged-creepers.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/naturally-charged-creepers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">自然充能苦力怕</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允許苦力怕以充能狀態生成，以增加遊戲難度。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-portal-spread\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/nether-portal-spread.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-portal-spread\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">下界門擴散</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">在下界門的可配置半徑範圍內，將（下界）方塊傳播到主世界。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/no-hostiles-around-campfire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/no-hostiles-around-campfire.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/no-hostiles-around-campfire\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">營火周圍無敵對生物</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">防止在可配置半徑範圍內的營火周圍生成敵對生物，並將其燒毀。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overworld-piglins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/overworld-piglins.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/overworld-piglins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">主世界豬布林</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">使豬布林和疣豬獸能夠在主世界中存活，除非它們被削弱。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pet-names\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/pet-names.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pet-names\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">寵物名稱</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">給可馴服的幼年動物賦予預定義的名稱。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/piglin-names\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/piglin-names.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/piglin-names\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">豬布林名稱</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">給所有豬布林賦予默認或自定義名稱，以豐富世界。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pumpkillagers-quest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/pumpkillagers-quest.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pumpkillagers-quest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">南瓜殺手的任務</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">驚悚節 2022：幫助南瓜殺手！通過自定義遭遇、獎勵和 Boss 戰讓你沉浸在故事中。在這個驚悚恐怖風格的萬聖節模塊中，打破南瓜即可召喚他！</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rain-be-gone-ritual\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/rain-be-gone-ritual.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rain-be-gone-ritual\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">止雨儀式</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">添加通過生存模式中的多方塊結構儀式來停止下雨的能力。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/random-village-names\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/random-village-names.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/random-village-names\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">隨機村莊名稱</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">所有村莊都獲得隨機名稱，通過 Areas 模塊在 GUI 中顯示。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/realistic-bees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/realistic-bees.gif\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/realistic-bees\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">真實蜜蜂</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">微小的蜜蜂，或者大的！更大的群體生成和增加的蜂巢空間。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/smaller-nether-portals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/smaller-nether-portals.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/smaller-nether-portals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更小的下界門</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">允許創建更小的下界門，特別是 1x2、1x3 和 2x2 尺寸。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowballs-freeze-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/snowballs-freeze-mobs.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowballs-freeze-mobs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">雪球凍結生物</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">用雪球擊中生物將使其在可配置的時間內凍結。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spiders-produce-webs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/spiders-produce-webs.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spiders-produce-webs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">蜘蛛產絲</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">當玩家靠近時，蜘蛛和洞穴蜘蛛可以定期產生蛛網。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/village-spawn-point\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/village-spawn-point.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/village-spawn-point\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">村莊重生點</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">將新世界的重生點設置為村莊的中心。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villager-names\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/villager-names.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/villager-names\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">村民名稱</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">給所有村民實體賦予默認或自定義名稱，以豐富世界。</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:56px\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weaker-spiderwebs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/web/logo/64/weaker-spiderwebs.png\" width=\"48\" height=\"48\"></a></td>\n<td style=\"width:250px\"><a style=\"font-size:15px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weaker-spiderwebs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">脆弱的蛛網</a></td>\n<td><span style=\"font-size:13px;color:#8a8d91\">穿過時，經過可配置的延遲後破壞蜘蛛網/蛛網。</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載仍託管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您可以自由在任何整合包中使用此套件。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的概覽及更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法在這麼多不同的模組頁面上追蹤留言，因此已關閉留言功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他任何事項，請前往 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 儲存庫</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
